From f6f6c63a473c7fec75c55fdbd4de27b3de592b8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:01:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Make remote navigation visible and audible

- Outline the focused row in a glass card with the accent, rounded like
  the card at the ends of a group, and drop the ripple's square focus
  tint that spilled past the card's corners.
- Play the navigation tick when an arrow key moves focus inside a view
  that handles the key itself, such as the homepage's scroll view; the
  framework only plays it for focus moves it makes on its own.
- Scroll the homepage search bar away with the list and fade it, so it
  no longer sits over the cards; it shows again at the top.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
